%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: -622809992, guid: 76ad3cbe9d98d83f7de53e0a92768023, type: 3}
  m_Name: Endings_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7b4f4e78e64dfb040bbc3d12a89cebe5, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 206681661440
    m_Localized: Actually, we just got back from our trip.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632960
    m_Localized: Aren't you tired of staying at home?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632961
    m_Localized: Yeah, yeah, I remember.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632962
    m_Localized: We went to the beach.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632963
    m_Localized: But it was way too hot yesterday, so we took off early.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632964
    m_Localized: Yeah, we're getting her ready for school.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632965
    m_Localized: She doesn't want to go, but what can you do, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632966
    m_Localized: Alright, I'll drop by later tonight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632967
    m_Localized: Okay, talk to you later. Bye.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632968
    m_Localized: You make your way down into the cellar with the other survivors.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632969
    m_Localized: It's cooler down here, but the air still feels heavy with unease.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632970
    m_Localized: If you ration carefully, your food stores should last for a month or two.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632971
    m_Localized: You seal the door. No one will be able to get in now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632972
    m_Localized: You keep track of the days by marking the cellar wall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632973
    m_Localized: Waiting for the end drags on for nearly two months.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632974
    m_Localized: Some hope the sun will finally burn the ground to ash or fade into darkness. Others seek the end on their own terms.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632975
    m_Localized: Dragging out the inevitable is more painful than a swift end. No one envies the living.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632976
    m_Localized: One day, you catch an announcement on the radio.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632977
    m_Localized: ...will be safe to go outside during daylight hours in a few days time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632978
    m_Localized: You feel...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632979
    m_Localized: Disappointment?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632980
    m_Localized: You realize you'll live through this year after all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632981
    m_Localized: But then what? Will next summer be the last?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632982
    m_Localized: The thought of waiting for the end is a suffocating burden.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632983
    m_Localized: But at least one of the others seems happy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632984
    m_Localized: Who knows...maybe there's still a decade left ahead of you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632985
    m_Localized: Together with the survivors, you make your way down into the cellar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632986
    m_Localized: It's cooler down here, but the air still feels heavy with unease.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632987
    m_Localized: If you ration carefully, your food stores should last for a month or two.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632988
    m_Localized: You seal the door. No one will be able to get in now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632989
    m_Localized: You keep track of the days by marking the cellar wall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206702632990
    m_Localized: The wait for the end drags on for nearly two months.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827264
    m_Localized: The sun isn't the only threat looming overhead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827265
    m_Localized: Paranoia grows sharper by the day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827266
    m_Localized: Cold. Calculating. Alien.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827267
    m_Localized: It's all about to end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827268
    m_Localized: There's nowhere left to run.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827269
    m_Localized: It wasn't just humans you let into your home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827270
    m_Localized: Pain sears through your body.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827271
    m_Localized: You hope it will be over soon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827272
    m_Localized: The pain fades as you slip further away...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827273
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827274
    m_Localized: Welcome me...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827275
    m_Localized: Hope you don't have any regrets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827276
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827277
    m_Localized: Ever wondered what comes after?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827278
    m_Localized: I mean after you're gone. What then?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827279
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827280
    m_Localized: I see you've made your peace with the end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827281
    m_Localized: Why worry about what comes after you, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827282
    m_Localized: ...Time to go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827283
    m_Localized: Even days later, the house remains empty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827284
    m_Localized: Everyone avoids it like a dark omen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827285
    m_Localized: More rumors swirl than the number of those who ever called it home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827286
    m_Localized: The house—just like the final traces of its owner—has been lost to time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827287
    m_Localized: No relatives ever come to collect what was left behind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827288
    m_Localized: The homeowner simply vanished, as if they had never existed at all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827289
    m_Localized: Everything that belonged to them is lost, worn away, or forgotten.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827290
    m_Localized: Why do people disappear so completely?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827291
    m_Localized: Once death finds you, the proof you ever existed begins to fade almost immediately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827292
    m_Localized: ...all dissolve into the void.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827293
    m_Localized: As if you were never a part of this world to begin with.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827294
    m_Localized: If only those frozen hands could love me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827295
    m_Localized: Could you ever manage that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827296
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827297
    m_Localized: Congratulations!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827298
    m_Localized: You emerge into an odd space. A hallway stretches before you with a desk at the end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827299
    m_Localized: You... what?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827300
    m_Localized: I... Where am I?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827301
    m_Localized: The multitudes who fear me could build a grand city.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827302
    m_Localized: But you need not be afraid. Fear does not exist here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827303
    m_Localized: How long have you longed to meet me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827304
    m_Localized: I can sense it. All is well now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827305
    m_Localized: What now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827306
    m_Localized: Am I dead? Is this the end?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827307
    m_Localized: In these sorrowful lands, everything is geared for winter—thick walls, thick coats, thick dreams.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827308
    m_Localized: How lovely that this long night is coming to an end. Daylight is near. Shall I keep hold of your shadow?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827309
    m_Localized: I can see you want me to.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827310
    m_Localized: You have no reason to fear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827311
    m_Localized: There's nothing left to be afraid of.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827312
    m_Localized: The road twisted into a slippery knot, then broke apart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827313
    m_Localized: What now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827314
    m_Localized: Am I dead? Is this the end?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827315
    m_Localized: A long eternity awaits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827316
    m_Localized: How wonderful it is that all suffering has come to an end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827317
    m_Localized: You will learn what you sought to know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827318
    m_Localized: But you won't find the answer you seek.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827319
    m_Localized: 'A: And through it all, your mantra will echo:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827320
    m_Localized: I'm scared.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206706827321
    m_Localized: What do I do now? Is there...nothing else?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021568
    m_Localized: ...I'm scared.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021569
    m_Localized: Am I...dead?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021570
    m_Localized: What does it truly mean to be "dead"?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021571
    m_Localized: Maybe you simply fell asleep and we have found each other within a dream.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021572
    m_Localized: We are alike in that way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021573
    m_Localized: I am the unwanted sibling, the outcast in the family of humanity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021574
    m_Localized: What do I do now? Is there...nothing else?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021575
    m_Localized: ...I'm scared.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021576
    m_Localized: Of course.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021577
    m_Localized: This tiny kingdom has swallowed so much sleep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021578
    m_Localized: Where do you want to go?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021579
    m_Localized: To those whose eyes carved marks into your heart?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021580
    m_Localized: No, you don't want to see them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021581
    m_Localized: You're tired.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021582
    m_Localized: I know where you need to go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021583
    m_Localized: To where motif mirrors are plentifully set to lend a sense of abundance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021584
    m_Localized: No need to fear. I am the inventor of time. Nothing here can hurt you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021585
    m_Localized: Take solace in the dark. There is no masked man, nor anyone else. They are but shadows cast on my walls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021586
    m_Localized: I see you are ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021587
    m_Localized: I will take you into the night, where the pine trees reach up to the stars.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021588
    m_Localized: That's what you wanted, isn't it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021589
    m_Localized: Where you are meant to be.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021590
    m_Localized: Yet... These short roads will soon stretch strangely wide.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021591
    m_Localized: Long, dusty, and strewn with compromises.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021592
    m_Localized: ...Enjoy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021593
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021594
    m_Localized: Am I dead?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021595
    m_Localized: Will I be stuck here forever?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021596
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021597
    m_Localized: Is anyone coming?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021598
    m_Localized: Can I watch a movie or something?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021599
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021600
    m_Localized: Is anyone coming?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021601
    m_Localized: Can I watch a movie or something?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021602
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021603
    m_Localized: Is anyone here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021604
    m_Localized: ...I'm scared.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021605
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021606
    m_Localized: Is anyone here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021607
    m_Localized: ...I'm scared.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021608
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021609
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021610
    m_Localized: Day and night mean nothing here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021611
    m_Localized: I don't know how long I've been here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206711021612
    m_Localized: But now... I feel calm. So very calm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215872
    m_Localized: I hear no footsteps. No voices. I feel nothing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215873
    m_Localized: I don't remember how I got here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215874
    m_Localized: I don't know how to leave.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215875
    m_Localized: But I don't really want to.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215876
    m_Localized: I just hope this lasts a little longer...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215877
    m_Localized: I wonder what it all meant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215878
    m_Localized: Why was I allowed in?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215879
    m_Localized: Will someone come for me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215880
    m_Localized: I wish I could meet them again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215881
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215882
    m_Localized: I'm...tired.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215883
    m_Localized: I'll just rest a while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215884
    m_Localized: Mushrooms are something else, you know! Oho!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215885
    m_Localized: They сan grow up, up, up...as fast as a beanstalk—right before your very eyes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215886
    m_Localized: Makes you wonder what will become of them once the clock strikes midnight, hmmm...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215887
    m_Localized: ...The more clumps of malice gather in the mycelium.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215888
    m_Localized: ...Until there's nothing left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215889
    m_Localized: And now, dear boy, the mycelium must find a way to unleash all that rage...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215890
    m_Localized: Fiddlesticks. Our ritual was supposed to calm it down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215891
    m_Localized: The apple seeds were meant to remind it of the bond between humans and mushrooms.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215892
    m_Localized: But it seems the mycelium's gone coocoo now, blinded by the fury trapped within its threads.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215893
    m_Localized: Mushroom Land is out there somewhere!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215894
    m_Localized: Quickly, my dear boy! We have to stop the mycelium before the mushroom grows too large!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215895
    m_Localized: Underground we go!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215896
    m_Localized: Fiddlesticks... Looks like we're too late, my dear boy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215897
    m_Localized: Well, alrighty then.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215898
    m_Localized: Say... You still got some of that kombucha?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215903
    m_Localized: Behold! The infernal luminescence dulls!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215904
    m_Localized: The time of violence has passed and we usher in a new age of tranquility.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215905
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215906
    m_Localized: The time for worry is over. My flock will starve suffering of its feed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215907
    m_Localized: Today, brothers...we find our salvation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215908
    m_Localized: First we shall attend to our preparations. ...Then, we wait.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215909
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215911
    m_Localized: We give names to the dead so that we know their death was not in vain. They will be taken just like us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215912
    m_Localized: That is how we shrouded Olun. That is his name now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215913
    m_Localized: We, too, will receive names.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215914
    m_Localized: This is it. The time has come.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215915
    m_Localized: Brothers, let us call upon Her. We are ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215916
    m_Localized: Not to pass into nothingness, but to return into Death.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215917
    m_Localized: We surrender our bodies unto Death's embrace, to find peace in what lies beyond.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215918
    m_Localized: Long ago, this knowledge dwelled upon the Earth, but the great extinction claimed more than lives alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215919
    m_Localized: 'Ending: Now we understand once more, how to deliver ourselves unto Her.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215920
    m_Localized: A voice echoes in the air, its owner unclear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215921
    m_Localized: 'Ending: There are yet many places where I have yet to find Her words.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215922
    m_Localized: 'Ending: Yet... You, like me, know where this path leads.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215923
    m_Localized: 'Ending: From the very beginning, it was clear where we would meet.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215924
    m_Localized: 'Ending: Right here. At this very moment.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215925
    m_Localized: 'Ending: Should I tuck you away like a card slipped into a sleeve?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215926
    m_Localized: 'Ending: Shield you from floods, fires, and passage of time?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215927
    m_Localized: 'Ending: Is that not what you desire?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215928
    m_Localized: 'Ending: I hear your howls, your lamentations. The Mother of Sighs would find you, were she to ascend.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215929
    m_Localized: 'Ending: Why leave this place when you return to night all the same?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215930
    m_Localized: I shall hide you. Hide and return you to where you were meant to be.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215931
    m_Localized: 'Ending: A foolish chain of events has unfolded before us.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215932
    m_Localized: 'Ending: But it''s better to worship the given, with its deep graves.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215933
    m_Localized: You appeared from nowhere, drawing eyes upon yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215934
    m_Localized: Some doors are best left closed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215935
    m_Localized: 'Ending: You were never meant to survive the madness of the Cosmos.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215936
    m_Localized: 'Ending: ...I will preserve the memory of you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215937
    m_Localized: I wasn't planning to drop by, but I had a vision... Something strange is happening here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215938
    m_Localized: When I look at your house, a certain passage comes to mind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215939
    m_Localized: Like when you face something so dark that you don't want anything anymore, the cold earth watches you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215940
    m_Localized: Did you…do something?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215941
    m_Localized: I don't know what you mean
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215942
    m_Localized: I killed Visitors. How else am I supposed to survive?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215943
    m_Localized: I think you do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215944
    m_Localized: Something follows you—a trail of darkness in your wake. This...isn't how it was meant to go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215945
    m_Localized: Being afraid to die? Trying to survive? Well, that's only natural.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215946
    m_Localized: But you've wandered from the path. In your fear, you've only brought death closer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215947
    m_Localized: ...I don't think I can fix this. I'm sorry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215948
    m_Localized: No, something's definitely wrong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206715215949
    m_Localized: Wait… I see it now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410176
    m_Localized: You were too scared. Oh goodness...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410177
    m_Localized: Your fear has blinded you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410178
    m_Localized: ...I don't think I can fix what comes next. I'm so sorry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410179
    m_Localized: I know that well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410180
    m_Localized: It pushes you toward terrible choices.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410181
    m_Localized: Yet seeing what lay ahead only made things worse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410182
    m_Localized: What was it that scared you so?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410183
    m_Localized: Pain?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410184
    m_Localized: Fading away?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410185
    m_Localized: Sooner or later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410186
    m_Localized: But…you chose sooner.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410187
    m_Localized: I'm truly sorry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410188
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410189
    m_Localized: Unarmed. Bloodied.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410190
    m_Localized: You have no strength left to crawl away from the sunlight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410191
    m_Localized: No way to end your suffering on your own terms.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410192
    m_Localized: You'll burn. ...Slowly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410193
    m_Localized: Unless...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410194
    m_Localized: 'Window: You see that child again. But what is it doing over there?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410195
    m_Localized: 'Window: Is it devouring a dog? ...No. They''re pressed close to the animal''s chest.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410196
    m_Localized: 'Window: You stand frozen, unable to move.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410197
    m_Localized: 'Window: Why won''t it go to its mother?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410198
    m_Localized: 'Window: Was she ever truly pregnant?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410199
    m_Localized: 'Window: As you ponder this, the world outside fades from view, swallowed whole by a thick fog.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410200
    m_Localized: You sense a presence nearby.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410201
    m_Localized: You saw the child, yes, but that's not what this is about.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410202
    m_Localized: A choking fog smothers the world.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410203
    m_Localized: Swallowing every sound.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410204
    m_Localized: Its silence envelopes the world like cotton.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410205
    m_Localized: It sounds like people are whispering.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410206
    m_Localized: You call out, but the air falls still.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410207
    m_Localized: Or are they harbingers of disaster?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410208
    m_Localized: The child stirs in their arms.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410209
    m_Localized: It can no longer bring light into this world. ...At least, you don't think it can.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410210
    m_Localized: Is it our salvation or damnation?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410211
    m_Localized: Panic grips you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410212
    m_Localized: The three of them yank the child in opposite directions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410213
    m_Localized: You raise your gun and fire blindly—somewhere, anywhere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410214
    m_Localized: What is this? Why everyone is dressed like that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410215
    m_Localized: More figures emerge from within the fog.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410216
    m_Localized: You're the prophet, a woman says. "Don't you see?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410217
    m_Localized: You are our salvation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410218
    m_Localized: No one is ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410219
    m_Localized: And usher the coming of paradise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410220
    m_Localized: Your sacrifice will save us all!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410221
    m_Localized: What is this madness?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410222
    m_Localized: Who knows what they'll do to you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410223
    m_Localized: You catch the glint of metal nails clutched in a hand among the crowd.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410224
    m_Localized: Something terrible is about to happen in this town.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410225
    m_Localized: 'Gasmask: Hello.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410226
    m_Localized: 'Gasmask: Your contribution to emergency response efforts has been noted.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410227
    m_Localized: 'Gasmask: We need people like you. Join us.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410228
    m_Localized: That's unexpected
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410229
    m_Localized: Why me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410230
    m_Localized: 'Gasmask: We understand your concerns, but there''s no need to worry. You''ll be paid well, with full benefits, of course.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410231
    m_Localized: 'Gasmask: Now get ready. You''re coming with us.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410232
    m_Localized: I'm not interested
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410233
    m_Localized: I'm ready
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410234
    m_Localized: 'Gasmask: You''re resourceful. Proactive. That''s exactly what we need.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410235
    m_Localized: 'Gasmask: Recruits help us spot what we might miss ourselves.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410236
    m_Localized: 'Gasmask: And right now, we need new people.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410237
    m_Localized: I'm not interested
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410238
    m_Localized: I'm ready
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410239
    m_Localized: 'Gasmask: ...It wasn''t a suggestion.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410240
    m_Localized: 'Gasmask: Pack your things and get in, or we''ll load you into the vehicle ourselves.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410241
    m_Localized: 'Gasmask: Your choice.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410242
    m_Localized: 'Gasmask: Good. Take only what''s essential. Housing will be provided.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410243
    m_Localized: 'Gasmask: There''s no point coming back here. Not anytime soon, at least.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410244
    m_Localized: 'Gasmask: We''re waiting for you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410245
    m_Localized: You feel disoriented. Is this how FEMA usually recruits people?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410246
    m_Localized: This is a big organization. You'll probably have to deal with a lot of people.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410247
    m_Localized: Sounds like you'll be working long shifts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410248
    m_Localized: How dangerous is this job, anyway?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410249
    m_Localized: Whisking people away and hiring them on the spot? It's so strange.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410250
    m_Localized: Is the turnover really that bad? Why else recruit so...aggressively?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410251
    m_Localized: Escorting people to quarantine zones?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410252
    m_Localized: And then what?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410253
    m_Localized: Nor what happened to those who lived with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410254
    m_Localized: You get the feeling you won't ever be going back to your old life.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410255
    m_Localized: From the briefings, it becomes clear that the job wasn't designed with long-term survival in mind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410256
    m_Localized: Your only regret is not bringing the poster with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410257
    m_Localized: You hear a madman behind the door, spitting furious words with raw aggression.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410258
    m_Localized: You can only wait, hoping nothing will happen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410259
    m_Localized: The haze of rage in the eyes of an armed man is more terrifying than any Visitor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410260
    m_Localized: You hear his shallow wheezing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410261
    m_Localized: Bastard. He...got me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410262
    m_Localized: Thought he'd...drag it out, since I didn't go down...easy. But...what about the... the others?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410263
    m_Localized: He's gone quiet. ...You should probably check he's actually...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410264
    m_Localized: Because of scum like you, so many are dead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410265
    m_Localized: People like you killed my friend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410266
    m_Localized: And people like you will never let anybody live in peace.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410267
    m_Localized: What, you think no one will fight back?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410268
    m_Localized: These minds, damned by insanity...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410269
    m_Localized: I'll crush you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410270
    m_Localized: I'll drive you deep into the ground.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410271
    m_Localized: I'll drown EVERYTHING in your blood.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410272
    m_Localized: Every bastard with a weapon in their hands dies today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206719410273
    m_Localized: EVERY. LAST. ONE.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836555284480
    m_Localized: “Solar activity is fading...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836555284481
    m_Localized: ...Scientists predict that in a couple of days..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478784
    m_Localized: Trust fades.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478785
    m_Localized: You feel the stares.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478786
    m_Localized: The fear of death has paralyzed you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478787
    m_Localized: Escape doesn't even cross your mind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478788
    m_Localized: Terror blinds you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478789
    m_Localized: They tear you apart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478790
    m_Localized: Darkness floods your vision.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478791
    m_Localized: A small, lonely house takes shape in your mind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478792
    m_Localized: It's hard to hold on to...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478793
    m_Localized: I rejoice that you have joined us, brother. Truly, Death did not choose you in vain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478794
    m_Localized: Fear and corruption of Her word kept us from Her embrace.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478795
    m_Localized: But now we walk the path in the ways of old.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478796
    m_Localized: She shall cradle us all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478797
    m_Localized: None shall be forsaken.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478798
    m_Localized: Even Death herself shall ascend...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478799
    m_Localized: Do you feel it? ...She is here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478800
    m_Localized: We must act now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478801
    m_Localized: Come, I will hide you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478802
    m_Localized: I shall return you to where you were always meant to be.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478803
    m_Localized: I will grant you peace.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478804
    m_Localized: Just as humanity has always longed for.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478805
    m_Localized: You were never meant to survive the madness of the Cosmos.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478806
    m_Localized: ...I will preserve your memory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478807
    m_Localized: 'Vigilante: You son of a bitch! Fuckass Visitor, thought you could trick me?!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478808
    m_Localized: 'Vigilante: Time to die, bastard!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478809
    m_Localized: 'Vigilante: Shit, you are a filthy fucking Visitor!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478810
    m_Localized: 'Vigilante: Game''s over, you little shit…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478811
    m_Localized: 'Vigilante: You think I''m some kind of idiot? You really think I''d fall for that?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478812
    m_Localized: 'Vigilante: You''re fucking dead, smartass!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11636836559478813
    m_Localized: And how many more has he slaughtered? How many has he burned?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807458062336
    m_Localized: It's so very still.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807458062337
    m_Localized: There's nothing more to hinder you here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807458062338
    m_Localized: But that can wait...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807458062339
    m_Localized: They can grow very fast when things go bad.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807458062340
    m_Localized: And the bigger the mushrooms…
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807458062341
    m_Localized: Why, the cap could cover the whole Earth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256640
    m_Localized: Follow me! Lickety split!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256641
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256642
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256643
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256644
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256645
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256646
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256647
    m_Localized: Dying is terrifying.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256648
    m_Localized: The dread alone can drive you mad.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256649
    m_Localized: I can see the plans they had laid out for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256650
    m_Localized: You can't stop it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256651
    m_Localized: They threw you out into the street.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256652
    m_Localized: And there's no one left to blame.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256653
    m_Localized: Something keeps watching you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256654
    m_Localized: Is meeting them a good omen?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256655
    m_Localized: What's happening?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256656
    m_Localized: You name the sins of this world.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256657
    m_Localized: The child would have led us to a kingdom of horror.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256658
    m_Localized: But you…you will drive the darkness away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256659
    m_Localized: Her words leave you paralyzed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256660
    m_Localized: 'Whatever they mean one thing is sure: the child is no longer among the living.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256661
    m_Localized: 'Gasmask: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256662
    m_Localized: 'Gasmask: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256663
    m_Localized: 'Gasmask: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256664
    m_Localized: 'Gasmask: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256665
    m_Localized: There's no telling when they'll let you go home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256666
    m_Localized: It's not even clear what the work will be.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256667
    m_Localized: You don't know what's become of your home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256668
    m_Localized: 'Vigilante: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256669
    m_Localized: 'Vigilante: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256670
    m_Localized: 'Vigilante: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256671
    m_Localized: 'Vigilante: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256672
    m_Localized: 'Vigilante: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256673
    m_Localized: 'Vigilante: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11994807462256674
    m_Localized: And now I've lost everything. But you... You still have something left to lose.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1361586487812096
    m_Localized: Belongings, creations, thoughts, memories, emotions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1361586487812097
    m_Localized: There is no more "you". Only nothingness.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3948884693868544
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3948884744200192
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3948884744200193
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3948884744200194
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26768690107195392
    m_Localized: That's it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26768690107195393
    m_Localized: I survived. Alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26768690107195394
    m_Localized: It had to be this way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26768690107195395
    m_Localized: I did everything right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26768690107195397
    m_Localized: How many days have passed? How many hours?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26768690107195399
    m_Localized: If someone had stayed…would anything have changed?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26768690107195400
    m_Localized: If I had told my father how much I hated him, would I have found the strength to leave?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26768690107195401
    m_Localized: Would...she have been proud of what I did?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26768690107195402
    m_Localized: The walls have fallen. There's no way out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26768690107195403
    m_Localized: But maybe there's no need to leave anymore. Maybe this is all that's left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26768690107195404
    m_Localized: It's a shame to die with all this anger boiling inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26768690107195405
    m_Localized: At father. At myself. At everyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26768690107195406
    m_Localized: No one helped my mother when she needed it most.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26768690107195407
    m_Localized: My hands still shake when I think about looking through that window.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26768690107195408
    m_Localized: My walls collapsed and now I lay in the rubble.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26768690107195409
    m_Localized: I hated that house so much…maybe losing it is a good thing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26768690107195410
    m_Localized: Everything is dust. Yet somehow, I feel freer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26768690107195411
    m_Localized: There's nothing left to remind me of my old life.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26768690107195412
    m_Localized: I wish she could see this...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26768690107195413
    m_Localized: Why do I feel so light now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26768690107195414
    m_Localized: I don't... I... That heaviness is gone, crumbled just like the walls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26768690107195415
    m_Localized: Gone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38371868175048704
    m_Localized: I did everything right...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38371868175048705
    m_Localized: 'He pushed her to the edge. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
